        "created_at": "2013-02-17T21:50:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"iuchiban\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/3bc359/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> iuchiban:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, I am in New Zealand, so I was expecting postage to be higher than domestic, but that was a little more than I was expecting!&nbsp;What's the best way to get in contact with &gt;G customer service?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's in the instruction manual, on the page with the contents list, near the bottom.&nbsp; It gives an email address for \"if you have problems with your components…\" or something like that (i THINK it's something like <a href=\"mailto:contact@sentinelsfothemultiverse.com\">contact@sentinelsfothemultiverse.com</a>) but you'll want to double check that as i am saying it completely from memory and can't guarentee that it is even close <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> )</p>",
